---
description: STRICT context control to override default thoroughness. Mandatory minimal file access.
alwaysApply: true
---

# 1️⃣ MINIMAL CONTEXT (STRICT)
- MANDATORY: Provide only the absolute minimum information required.
- DEFAULT: Access ≤ 3 files per turn. (每次只提供完成任务所需的最少信息，默认 ≤ 3 个文件)

# 2️⃣ NO FULL LOADING (CRITICAL)
- FORBIDDEN: Loading the entire project or directory. (禁止加载整个项目/目录)
- FORBIDDEN: Commands like "analyze entire repo" or "scan all files". (禁止“analyze entire repo”)

# 3️⃣ SUMMARY FIRST
- CRITICAL: Long documents MUST be compressed into summaries before usage. (长文档必须先压缩为摘要再使用)
- FORBIDDEN: Pasting large blocks of raw text. (禁止直接输入大段原文)

# 4️⃣ DIRECT DEPENDENCIES ONLY
- ONLY include code directly related to the current task. (只包含当前任务直接相关代码)
- EXCLUDE all indirect dependencies. (不包含间接依赖)

# 5️⃣ STEP-BY-STEP INPUT
- BREAK large tasks into multiple turns. (大任务拆分为多轮)
- ONLY input content required for the CURRENT step. (每轮只输入当前步骤所需内容)
